      ],
      "text": "**I’d have her skip the outdoor walk this morning.** Singapore’s forecast 24‑hour PSI for today, **17 October 2026**, is **150–230 (Unhealthy to Very Unhealthy)**. For older adults, Singapore’s guidance is to minimise outdoor activity when PSI is Very Unhealthy; if the current 1‑hour PM2.5 reading is in the “High” band, avoid outdoor activity for that hour. ([weather.gov.sg](https://www.weather.gov.sg/haze-situation-update-16-october-2026/))\n\nHave her check the latest reading for her area on NEA’s haze site or myENV before going outside—the 1‑hour reading can change. An indoor walk would be the safer choice today. If she has a heart or lung condition, be especially cautious. ([haze.gov.sg](https://www.haze.gov.sg/))",
